  'Atlantic coast: 28–31″, open Jan 1 – Mar 31 and May 16 – Dec 31. The Chesapeake Bay and its rivers have different dates and sizes (check VMRC). Landlocked lakes: 4 per day, 20″ minimum (Smith Mountain, Gaston, Claytor, Kerr have special rules).',
  'https://webapps.mrc.virginia.gov/public/reports/swrecfishingrules.php', '2026-10-21', true),
