 ('Crappie', array['crappie','speckled perch'], array['VA'], null, null, 'total', false, '25 per day (black and white together)', false, null, null,
  'No statewide size limit. Lake Gaston, Kerr, Briery Creek, Sandy River, Flannagan and South Holston have a 9–10″ minimum or a different limit.',
